# NeuroNav Benchmark Integration — Work Summary
**Date:** 22 October 2026  
**Project:** NeuroNav — LangMap/HM3D Benchmark Integration  
**Status:** ✅ End-to-end benchmark pipeline validated

## 1. Project Objective

Our objective was to integrate **NeuroNav with the official LangMap benchmark using Habitat-Sim**, establishing a reproducible evaluation pipeline for future exploration and predicate-guided navigation research.

The benchmark must support:

- Loading official LangMap episodes into Habitat.
- Initializing the robot at the official starting position and orientation.
- Building an environment representation using Hydra.
- Generating and selecting feasible frontier navigation goals.
- Executing navigation using the team's Habitat Oracle controller.
- Recording robot trajectories and exploration progress.
- Evaluating navigation performance using official LangMap criteria.
- Generating per-episode and aggregate evaluation reports.

**Our contribution is benchmark integration and evaluation infrastructure, not a new exploration algorithm.**

